  "summary": "Customers report severe delays caused by mechanical failures, including tire tread issues, uncharged batteries, and wire system malfunctions [#tk_671470] [#tk_79591] [#tk_1947858]. These technical problems frequently result in missed connections, forcing passengers to lose critical business meetings or risk job loss [#tk_2631921] [#tk_2885333]. Additionally, inefficient de-icing processes and gate equipment malfunctions exacerbate frustration and lead to stranded travelers [#tk_2601036] [#tk_2615524]. Passengers explicitly request proactive rebooking assistance to prevent being left without viable transportation options [#tk_2708612] [#tk_2736104]."
